COMMERCIAL MACHINE:', 'OXYCLE', 'Geller', '', '', 21, 'OXY CLEAN Oxygenated Laundry Bleach Oxy Clean is a concentrated laundry bleach powder. The commercial equivalent of Napi San, it is recommended for all fabrics including colours, wool, silk and synthetic.', true, 'Please contact us to get a copy of our Product Information Sheet', 'Please contact us to get a copy of our Product Information Sheet', 'CODE: OXYCLE05|Oxy CLean 5kg
