Floor & Wall: Mix 1 part Lu-Blu to 60 parts water. Produces a powerful effective everyday floor and wall cleaner..  

MPI APPROVED C32 (All animal product except dairy) Dishes and equipment may be washed immediately or left to soak to improve results. May be rinsed prior to air or clean-towel drying. In food processing premises, after using this compound, food contact surfaces must be thoroughly rinsed with potable water before production starts', 'LUBLU', 'Geller', '', 'documents/LuBlu_SDS.pdf', 21, 'LU BLUE Toilet Disinfectant Cleaner A powerful disinfectant/cleaner/deodoriser.  Ideal as a toilet bowl cleaner, as well as for general bathroom cleaning.
USES: Toilet bowls, showers, basins,stainless steel, porcelain urinals and other washable bathroom surfaces.', true, 'Please contact us to get a copy of our Product Information Sheet', 'Please contact us to get a copy of our Product Information Sheet', 'CODE: LUBLU05|Lu Blue 5ltr
