CITRADET is a hardworking neutral detergent with a fresh lemon fragrance to make tough jobs more pleasant, and maintains foam and cleaning ability under greasy conditions yet contains additives to retain skin softness and reduce skin swelling that often occurs during prolonged immersion.

CITRADET is premium blend of lemon oils, coconut oil derivatives, glycerine, plus anionic and non-ionic surfactants. It emulsifies, wets, and suspends all soil types, moreover foam and performance is maintained through the toughest soils.

CITRADET is non-corrosive to metals, paints and plastics, but undiluted CITRADET should never be left in contact with painted surfaces or plastics as penetration and softening may occur.', false, '', '', 'C2033050L20
C2033060L200', 'Premium Lemon Dishwash Liquid', 'Premium Lemon Dishwash Liquid');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (405, 'Freshmint', 'documents/Freshmint_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Use at the rate of 3-5mls per litre of water depending on the degree of soiling.

To prevent microbial contamination, close containers immediately after use and do not add or insert any foreign materials or objects.', 'C2011290L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Freshmint_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_FRESHMINT_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Freshmint is a neutral viscous green liquid with a pleasant mint fragrance. It is specifically formulated to meet today’s requirements for an environmentally friendly product. It is biodegradable and phosphate free.

Freshmint is a general purpose detergent for use in all cleaning operations and catering areas. It is gentle to the hands and its rich lather removes the most stubborn soils.

Freshmint performs effectively in both soft and hard water & dries quickly to a streak free sparkling finish. As well as an excellent dishwashing detergent, Freshmint is ideal for cleaning walls, paintwork, and benches, worktops, pots, car and truck washing.', false, '', '', 'C2010690L20', 'Mild General Purpose Mint Perfumed Detergent', 'Mild General Purpose Mint Perfumed Detergent');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (406, 'Griller', 'documents/Griller_5L_QoHhntG.jpg', 'documents/Oven__Grill_Cleaner_Icon.png', '', 'Using undiluted, pour or brush over surfaces to be degreased. Leave for several minutes, agitating with a stiff brush or scraper to assist removal of soiling. Re-apply as needed. Rinse with fresh water to finish. Avoid spraying. Only apply to cooled surfaces to avoid splatter and fuming. 
DO NOT USE ON ALUMINIUM SURFACES - SHAKE WELL BEFORE USE', 'C2055290L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Griller_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_GRILLER_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Griller is a heavy duty oven and hot-plate cleaner for applications where there is not enough time to wait for the action of normal cleaners. The chemical activity is boosted to allow for quicker removal of fats and grease. Griller can also be used as a drain and sewer cleaner / maintainer.', false, '', '', '', 'Oven and Grill Cleaner', 'Oven and Grill Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (407, 'Caskade Spotless', '', 'documents/Dishwash_Liquid_Icon.png', '', 'WARNING: This product is highly alkaline: wear gloves, goggles and protective clothing if contact is likely.
GENERAL DOSAGE: 2.0mL/L
LIPSTICK REMOVAL: 5.0mL/L
CONTROLLERS: Please contact us regarding all aspects of dosing control.', 'C2001970L05', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Spotless is a concentrated liquid designed to clean kitchenware effectively in both hard and soft water areas.

Spotless will remove difficult soils such as lipstick from glassware and crockery, then its’ free rinsing properties will allow the ware to dry spotlessly, often without the need for a rinse additive.

When the tightest standards of hygiene and quality must be guaranteed we recommend the use of Clear rinse aid with Spotless. Ware is then certain to be Spotlessly Clear!

Spotless contains deflocculating agents, peptising agents, soil suspending agents, dark red colour, and a minimum of 120g/L sodium hydroxide.', false, '', '', 'C2000840L20
C2000860L200
C2000870IBC', 'Automatic Dishwasher Liquid', 'Automatic Dishwasher Liquid');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (408, 'Hc25 Mdw', '', 'documents/AutoDishwash_Icon.png', '', 'HC25 MDW is made specifically for use in dishwashing machines. Not to be used for washing
dishes by hand. HC25 MDW should be dispensed through. Integra dose equipment for maximum
use, cost benefit and optimum results. HC25 MDW should be introduced into a machine at a
rate of 2-4mL/L of water depending on the soil load and water hardness. Rinse all product
contacting surfaces with potable water after use. For best results HC25 MDW should be used in conjunction with Caskade SPOT AID.', 'C2000920L20', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_HC25_MDW_SDS.pdf', 72, 'HC25 MDW is an automatic alkaline dishwashing detergent for use only with Caskade electronic dispensing equipment. It combines good soil removal with low foaming and free rinsing characteristics. HC25 MDW is formulated from an alkaline base with chelating and soil suspension agents to handle both hard and soft water conditions. Its special properties help prevent scale build up in hard water areas. For better rinsing results use Caskade SPOT AID or CLEAR AID.', false, '', '', '', 'Automatic Machine Dishwashing Detergent', 'Automatic Machine Dishwashing Detergent');
