INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (416, 'Bathroom Pal', 'documents/Bathroom_Pal_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Laundry Applications - 1:20 (5% soln, 50ml per litre).
Kitchen and Bathrooms - Wet mop or wipe at 1:50 (2% soln, 20ml per litre).
Outdoor Hard Surfaces - 1:5 to 1:1 (20% - 50% soln).
Never use on wool or silk, and not recommended for use on coloured or sensitive garments as streaking, fading or other deterioration could result.', 'C2033280L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Bathroom_Pal_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_BATHROOM_PAL_.pdf', 72, 'Bathroom Pal - Thickened Bleach is a commercial bleach specially formulated to cling to surfaces for longer contact time. Suitable for domestic and commercial janitorial applications, and is effective as a toilet bowl cleaner or also as a chlorine sanitiser. Effective against a wide range of bacteria, fungi and algae. Free available chlorine–50gpl Sodium Hypochlorite at time of packing.', false, '', '', '', 'Thickened Bleach / Sanitiser and Cleaner', 'Sanitiser and Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (418, 'Clarks Stainless Steel Oil Polish', 'documents/SSCLEANER_360x.webp', '', '', 'Use as instructed', 'N/A', 'Clarks', '', 'documents/Clark_Stainless_Steel_Polish_Aerosol_Dec_2020.pdf', 72, 'Non abrasive spray and wipe formula that will clean, polish and protect your stainless steel surfaces.

Suitable for use on stainless steel, chrome, aluminium and other interior metal surfaces.', false, '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (419, 'Nova Neutral', 'documents/Nova_Neutral_5L.jpg', 'documents/Floor_Cleaner_Icon.png', '', 'Dust mop floor first – can be used as a manual applied or thru a Auto scrubber
For most general wet mopping applications use at a ratio of 1:100 (1% soln, 10mls per litre) with potable water.
For heavier cleaning use at a ratio of 1:50 (2% soln, 20mls per litre)
May be diluted stronger or weaker depending on the level of soiling and sensitivity of floor coating.', 'C2102355L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_NOVA_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Nova Neutral is a highly dilutable neutral detergent suitable for cleaning hard surfaces especially those coated in protectant or floor polish.Polished surfaces simply cannot afford high pH cleaners due to their “stripping” characteristics - making Nova Neutral the perfect solution for expensive, high finish floors.', false, '', '', 'C2102356L20', 'All Purpose Floor Cleaner', 'Floor Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (420, 'Citrus Orange Eco Cleaner', 'documents/Capture.JPG', '', '', 'Dilution rates will vary depending on application.
For Light cleaning use at a ratio of 25ml per litre litre with potable water.
For usual medium duty cleaning use at a ratio of 50ml per litre with potable water.
For heavy duty cleaning use at a ratio of 100 ml per litre litre with potable water.', 'C2042540L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_CITRUS_ORANGE_ECO_SDS.pdf', 61, 'Citrus Orange Eco Cleaner combines a heavy duty detergent system with a powerful disinfectant and natural citrus solvents. Citrus Orange Eco Cleaner cleans and sanitisers all surfaces and is safe on all metals including aluminium. Citrus Orange Eco Cleaner can be used for a number of purposes from degreasing equipment, to dissolving cooking oils and baked on grime from kitchen surfaces. It is also an excellent floor cleaner', false, '', '', '', 'General Hard Surface Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (421, 'Blue San', 'documents/Bluesan.JPG', 'documents/Spray_Surface_Icon_9chsna9.png', '', 'To disinfect pre cleaned hard surfaces use 60ml to 10ltrs of water. To disinfect pre cleaned porous surfaces use 120ml to 10ltrs of water -This can be applied using a standard spray bottle .To Sanitise pre cleaned equipment ,rinse or soak in a solution of 30ml per 10ltrs of water and allow to drain', 'C2034003L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/BLUESAN_August_2019.pdf', 61, 'Blue San is a powerful quat based anti-bacterial surface sanitizer
that cleans, disinfects and deodorizes eliminating 99.9% of the most
common germs and bacteria. Blue San is formulated for uses in
environments where surfaces contact food.', false, '', '', '', 'Concentrated Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (422, 'Safeguard', 'documents/Safeguard_5L.jpg', 'documents/Toilet_Bowl_Cleaner_Icon.png', '', 'Direct onto the urinal or toilet bowl paying particular attention to the hard to get areas. Apply sufficient amount so that the liquid runs into the trap or the bottom of the bowl. Allow to act, scrub with a toilet brush if necessary, and flush.', 'C2021570L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Safeguard_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASAKDE_SAFEGUARD_SDS_2021.pdf', 61, 'SAFEGUARD is an economical sulphamic acid based urinal and toilet bowl cleaner with antibacterial properties. It acts safely and efficiently in removing scale, uric encrustation, toilet stains and algae growth leaving the surfaces clean, reodorised, with a long lasting fragrance. It contains active biocides which allow for rapid bacterial kill.', false, '', '', '', 'Toilet Bowl Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (423, 'Advance', '', '', '', 'Dispense a small amount of Advance onto hands, gently work up a rich lather and rinse with water.

To prevent microbial contamination of the product, close containers immediately after use and do not add or insert any foreign materials or objects.

Consult your Caskade representative for further information.', 'C2073740L05', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Advance is a liquid hand soap of neutral pH which has been formulated with a combination of mild surfactants, emollients and moisturisers. It is gentle clean and supports healthy skin. It is ideal for use in all washroom facilities at hotels, restaurants, nursing homes, hospitals and other establishments, in order to maintain an optimum level of personal hygiene.', false, '', '', 'C2073740L20', 'Perfumed Hand Soap', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (424, 'Airshield That''S Nice', '', '', '', 'See product label for directions.', 'C3000500TN', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Caskade AirShield combines an effective disinfectant with a pleasant lingering perfume to destroy airborne bacteria and freshen up living and working areas. AirShield is effective against most common odours including cooking smells, mustiness, cigarette, and cigar smoke.This is also a surface spray disinfectant - hospital grade. Highly effective alcohol-based sanitiser which also contains our Unique disinfectant to give additional sanitising power.

AirShield is a 3in1 Surface Disinfectant & Air Sanitizer that kills 99.9% of germs, bacteria, viruses and fungi on hard, non-porous surfaces. It disinfects and deodorizes by killing common germs and controlling their odors. It works to eliminate odors in the air by killing odor-causing bacteria, and also prevents odors at their source caused by germs, bacteria and mildew. AirShield 3in1 also deodorizes soft surfaces.', false, '', '', '', 'Metered Air Care Systems', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (425, 'All Kleen', 'documents/All_Kleen_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Apply manually by wiping, mopping or brushing. (Can be used in immersion in heated, aerated soak tanks.) Allkleen will work in cold water but is most effective with a water temperature around 60 – 70°C. Aeration of immersion tanks will also improve cleaning. Use also for machine application steam cleaners, high-pressure sprayers and floor scrubbers with vacuum pick-up.

Dilution rates vary with soiling but typically:
1:10 - For heavy soiling, i.e. steam/pressure cleaners, degreasing etc.
1:40 – For floors, walls, glass, paintwork, tile and light degreasing.
1:60 - For light soiling i.e. kitchen and janitorial cleaning and painted surfaces etc', 'C2035330L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/AllKleen_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_ALLKLEEN_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Allkleen is an economical, heavy duty universal cleaner and degreaser.It is a clear red liquid and is specifically formulated for the effective removal of a variety of greases and fat even in extreme hard water conditions and it is ideal for cleaning in food preparation areas. Allkleen can be used for all heavy duty cleaning tasks where the surface is not adversely affected by alkalinity. It also removes other soils including mineral oils, waxes, built up soap deposits clays and carbon. Since it is water based it is an alternative to flammable solvent degreasers, particularly in areas of high fire and explosion risk.

Allkleen can be used on any washable surface such as:
•Floors & walls
•Baths & showers
•Tools & machinery
•Barbecues, grills, ovens, hotplates, deep fryers
•Exterior cladding & roofs
•Refrigerators
•Sinks & basins', false, '', '', 'C2033930L20
C2033750L200', 'Cleaner/Degreaser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (426, 'All Kleen Plus', 'documents/AllKleen_Plus_5L.jpg', 'documents/Grill_Cleaner_Icon_jL4gAgp.png', '', 'Use manually or via high pressure spray equipment, soak tank or automatic scrubbers at a dilution rate of 1:10 to 1:60 with hot or cold water depending on the degree of soiling. For food areas, rinse off product contacting surfaces with potable water after use. 

Consult your Caskade representative for further details.', 'C2055130L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/AllKleen_Plus_PI.pdf', 'documents/ALL_KLEEN_PLUS_SDS.pdf', 72, 'All Kleen Plus is a heavy duty alkaline cleaner and degreaser specifically formulated to rapidly emulsify fat, grease and oil, even in hard water conditons. It is ideal for use on concrete floors, food processing equipment, boat decks and bilges, as well as for engine degreasing.', false, '', '', 'C2052730L20', 'Heavy Duty Universal Cleaner & Degreaser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (427, 'Big L', 'documents/BigL_5L.jpg', '', '', 'As a general rule for more residual fragrance, use cold to warm water. For greater cleaning power, use warm or hot water. Do not mix with soaps or detergents based on ionic surfactants which will lower efficiency Deodorant Cleaner 1 part Product to 40 parts water (1:40) Disinfectant 1part Product to 20 parts water (1:20).', 'C2044000L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_BIG_L_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Big L is a neutral yellow disinfectant cleaner containing a long lasting lemon fragrance.

Big L has excellent cleaning properties which combined with a powerful disinfecting capacity make it an ideal cleaner for soiled areas where odours caused by micro-organisms are encountered. Big L removes odours by killing the bacteria which cause them.

Big L can be used on any surface as a cleaner, disinfectant or reoderant, and can be used with hot or cold water thus giving versatility in use.

Big L is ideal for areas such as:
• Toilets • Washrooms • Shower recesses • Hard floors
• Rubbish Bins • Benches etc', false, '', '', 'C2042380L20', 'Lemon Disinfectant - Commercial Grade', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (428, 'Bluewash', 'documents/Bluewash_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Light soiling use at 30-45mls per standard laundry load*
Medium soiling at 50-65mls
Heavy soiling at 70-100mls

*Standard laundry load is approximately 4-5kg dry-weight laundry. Ensure solution
is thoroughly rinsed from garments prior to drying.', 'C2066110L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Bluewash_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_BLUEWASH_LIQUID_LAUNDRY_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Heavy-duty laundry detergent leaving clothes clean and bright with a fresh fragrance.
Suitable for use in all domestic and commercial washing top and front loading
machines. Contains powerful surfactants and optical brightening agents to enhance
fabric appearance. Works well on light, medium and heavy soiling, and is suited to
domestic, hotel, motel and on-premise laundry applications. Do not apply directly
onto fabric without diluting. Suitable for use in hot or cold water.', false, '', '', 'C2064480L20', 'Concentrated Laundry Liquid Detergent', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (429, 'Bowl Clean', 'documents/BowlClean_5L.jpg', 'documents/Toilet_Bowl_Cleaner_Icon.png', '', 'Pour Bowl Cleaner neat on the area to be cleaned. Use a brush to remove heavy soiling.

Use on a cloth to wipe the exterior of toilet bowls and seats. If used on the seat, rinse with a clean cloth and dry. For urinals, flush urinal and wipe all over with Bowl Clean, including areas not covered by the flush.

Note: Excessive use of BOWL CLEAN on stainless steel could cause surface damage through acidic action, but occasional use followed with thorough rinsing should have no adverse reaction.', 'C2021230L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/BowlClean_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_BOWL_CLEAN_SDS_2020.pdf', 72, 'Bowl Clean is a clear blue liquid disinfectant cleaner that mixes readily in water. It has fresh, spicy odours leaving toilet areas smelling fresh and clean.
