Bowl Clean is a very powerful disinfectant, and when used undiluted direct from the container will cling to surfaces to prolong its cleaning action. Use Bowl Clean for powerful and effective cleaning of toilet bowls and rims, seats, urinals and other toilet areas.', false, '', '', 'C2021170L20
C2021170L200', 'Toilet Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (430, 'Carousel', '', '', '', 'For general use: disinfecting toilet, bathroom and kitchen floor areas, washing benches, paint work, rubbish tins, drains etc, use 1 part Carousel to 40 parts water (25mL per litre).

As a general rule for increased residual fragrance, increase the concentration of Carousel used.
Carousel can be used neat in problem areas such as dog kennels, catteries or rotting refuse..', 'C2044020L05', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Carousel Deodorant is a highly perfumed quaternary ammonium based disinfectant.

Carousel is suitable for use in and around areas where unwanted odours are objectionable.

Carousel is extremely efficient in deodorising and disinfecting kennels and catteries. The distinctive odour of Carousel is quite safe to use in septic systems.', false, '', '', 'C2042410L20', 'Cleaner/Deodorant - Fresh Fruit Fragrance', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (431, 'Citrus Cleaner', 'documents/Citrus_Cleaner_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Dilution rates will vary depending on application.

For General Cleaning: use Citrus Cleaner at a dilution rate of 1 in 80. For heavier soils and baked on dirt, a 1 in 40 dilution rate may be required. Rinse surface with potable water after use. Citrus Cleaner may be used through a higher pressure cleaner and is considered safe to use on all surfaces including aluminium.', 'C2042530L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Citrus_Clean_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_CITRUS_CLEANER_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Citrus Cleaner is a bright yellow liquid combining a heavy duty detergent system with a powerful disinfectant and natural citrus solvents. Citrus Cleaner cleans and sanitisers all surfaces and is safe on all metals including aluminium. Citrus Cleaner can be used for a number of purposes from degreasing equipment, to dissolving cooking oils and baked on grime from kitchen surfaces. It is also an excellent floor cleaner.', false, '', '', 'C2180710L20', 'Heavy Duty Cleaner, Disinfectant & Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (432, 'Clean Green Detergent', 'documents/Clean_Green_20L.jpg', '', '', 'Manual sink washing application, use at a ratio of 1:500 (0.25% soln, 25mls per 10ltrs) in warm potable water (more or less depending on soiling levels). Hard surface applications, use at a ratio of 5 to 30mls per 10 litres of water, depending on the level of soiling. Window cleaning use 5mls per 10 litres of water. Spray onto windows and wipe with clean paper towel. Vehicle washing use 20mls per 10 litres of water. Sponge onto vehicle and rinse with water', 'C2010950L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_CLEAN_GREEN_DETERGENT_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Clean Green is suitable for cleaning all kitchen cutlery, pots, and dishes, plus may be used to clean vehicles, boats, walls, hands and most other washable surfaces.
Clean Green is a hardworking neutral detergent with a fresh lemon fragrance to make tough jobs more pleasant, and maintains foam and cleaning ability under greasy conditions yet contains additives to retain skin softness and reduce skin swelling that often occurs during prolonged immersion.

Clean Green is non-corrosive to metals, paints and plastics, but undiluted Clean Green should never be left in contact with painted surfaces or plastics as penetration and softening may occur.', false, '', '', 'C2010880L20', 'Hand Dishwash Liquid - Biodegradable', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (433, 'Coolsan', 'documents/Coolsan_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Hands must be washed before the application of COOLSAN. Spray or squirt enough (about 10ml) COOLSAN onto hands to thoroughly wet and lubricate, rub all over then allow to evaporate.

Suitable for use on food contact surfaces. Apply Coolsan wet for 60 seconds allowing to evaporate. Suitable for use on water sensitive equipment as it will not corrode.', 'C2073680L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_COOLSAN_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Coolsan provides a sterile rinse to hygienically dry hands after washing and also used to sanitise hard surfaces.
Coolsan contains 70% alcohol to achieve good performance with optimum operator safety.

Coolsan''s sterilising action is based on a high (70% approx.) alcohol content which is very effective even with contact times as low as 5 seconds.

Coolsan is a clear blue coloured liquid with a characteristic ethanol odour containing about 70% alcohol plus and food colouring.', false, '', '', 'C2071650L20', 'Ethanol based hand and surface sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (434, 'Coolwash', 'documents/Coolwash_20kg.jpg', '', '', 'DOMESTIC USE: 1 scoop per normal 5kg wash. Up to 2 scoops for heavily soiled garments.
COMMERCIAL USE: Use between 7 & 14gms/kilo of laundry (scoop holds 35 gms).

*Standard laundry load is approximately 4-5kg dry-weight laundry. Ensure solution is thoroughly rinsed from garments prior to drying.', 'C2064220KG05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Coolwash_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_COOLWASH_SDS.pdf', 72, 'A highly concentrated powder suitable for commercial and domestic use, including front-loading machines. Does not contain bulk fillers. Contains powerful surfactants and optical brightening agents to enhance fabric appearance. Works well on light, medium and heavy soiling, and is suited to domestic, hotel, motel and on-premise laundry applications. Do not apply directly onto fabric without diluting. Suitable for use in hot or cold water.', false, '', '', 'C2064221KG10
C2064222KG20', 'Concertrated Laundry Powder', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (435, 'Dynabrite', 'documents/Dynabrite_5L.jpg', '', '', 'HYGIENE: Surfaces must be cleaned then hard, non-porous surfaces should be treated with 0.4% (40ml/10L) DYNABRITE and porous surfaces with 1.6% (160mL/10L). Allow 20 minutes before rinsing.
TOILETS: Pour 30mL DYNABRITE around bowl, leave 20 minutes or more.
LAUNDRY: Add 60mLDYNABRITE pre-diluted with water per wash to give a cleaner more hygienic load.
STAINS: Soak whites separately from coloureds in 25mL DYNABRITE per 5L, then rinse. Do not use on wool or silk.
NAPPIES: Pre-soak with 30mL per 5L for 20 minutes. Wash as usual.
MOULD & MOSS: Use undiluted.
WARNING: DO NOT MIX OTHER CHEMICALS. WEAR GLOVES, PROTECT SKIN AND EYES.', 'C2063630L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/DynaBrite_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_DYNABRITE_2021.pdf', 72, 'DynaBrite main use is to achieve hygienic conditions. Because micro-organisms do not build-up resistance to bleach, and bleach kills all known bacteria and viruses, bleach is the safest sanitiser to use.

DynaBrite is suitable for all home, farm, and industrial applications, plus is MAF approved for sanitising edible area surfaces provided the surface is rinsed with potable water before use.

DynaBrite degrades completely to sodium chloride (salt) from which it was made, without harm to the environment.

DynaBrite contains 4.8 + 0.2% Sodium Hypochlorite when packed.', false, '', '', 'C2066270L20', 'Super Strength Bleach containing Sodium Hypochlorite', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (436, 'Freeway', 'documents/Freeway_5L.jpg', '', '', 'HEAVY CLEANING & DEGREASING 20% (1:5)
MAINTENANCE CLEANING 5% (1:20) for toilets, showers, floors in washrooms.
1.5% (1:60) for vinyl, floors, walls, etc. in traffic areas
LIGHT MAINTENANCE 0.75% (1:150) for glass, tiles
SPRAY BUFFING NEAT to 10% (up to 1:10) provides cleaning and gloss', 'C2033140L20', 'Caskade', 'documents/Freeway_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_FREEWAY_FLOOR_CLEANER.pdf', 72, 'Freeway is a broad spectrum cleaner capable of removing most soil types easily from walls, floors, benches, bowls and painted surfaces.
Freeway has a two way disinfecting action: alkyl-benzyl dimethyl-ammonium-chloride provides the activity against gram positive bacteria whereas the terpineol naturally present in the pine oil base provides synergistic activity against gram negative bacteria. This synergistic activity is especially useful in hospital situations where a broad-spectrum sanitiser is required at a low cost. Odour causing bacteria are controlled and replaced by a natural fresh perfume.
Freeway is effective in hot and cold water, in hard water, and is sufficiently low foaming to be used with automatic scrubbing equipment. It is concentrated allowing economical dilution yet it’s totally organic formulation means no rinsing is required.', false, '', '', 'C2033150L200
C2035330L05', 'Floor & Multi-Purpose Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (437, 'Gleem Lotion', 'documents/Gleem_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Apply Gleem Lotion  undiluted with a moist cloth. Polish with a clean dry cloth.
To prevent microbial contamination, close containers immediately after use and do not add or insert any foreign materials or objects.
Consult your Caskade representative for further information.', 'C2035130L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Gleem_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_GLEEM_LOTION.pdf', 72, 'Gleem Lotion is an economical all purpose cleaner for general cleaning of kitchens, bathrooms, and general housekeeping areas. It is a blend of mild detergent ingredients and mild abrasives complemented with fresh long lasting lemon fragrance. GLEEM LOTION can safely be used on chromium, stainless steel and other metal surfaces, pots, pans, sinks, baths, basins, tiles, Venetians blinds, rubber, plastics, , porcelain and enamel surfaces.', false, '', '', '', 'All Purpose Cream Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (438, 'Hydrogen Peroxide 35%', '', '', '', 'Bleaching with HYDROGEN PEROXIDE 35% FOOD GRADE is accelerated by heat or by increasing the pH of the bleach bath.

HYDROGEN PEROXIDE 35% FOOD GRADE contains an acidic stabiliser that becomes ineffective when the product is diluted. Stock solutions of hydrogen peroxide decompose rapidly; only make enough for one day at any one time. The presence of dust hastens decomposition therefore dust should be excluded as much as possible.', 'C2190210L20', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'HYDROGEN PEROXIDE 35% FOOD GRADE is the bleach of choice for food products because the degradation products are water and oxygen.

Bleaching with HYDROGEN PEROXIDE 35% FOOD GRADE will create an effluent stream that is free of additional halogenated compounds and is therefore much more environmentally acceptable then other common bleaches.', false, '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (439, 'King Hit', '', '', '', 'For usual medium duty cleaning use at a ratio of 1:10 (10% solution, 100mls per litre) with potable water.
For heavy duty cleaning use at a ratio of 1:2 (50% solution, 500 ml per litre).
For Power cleaning, use undiluted . Rinse with water after use.', 'C2035335L05', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'King Hit is an very effective mild degreaser and cleaner for use in a wide range of applications: walls, floors, machine parts, kitchens and benches. It contains powerful wetting agents to cut through built up grime layers.', false, '', '', '', 'Multi-purpose Cleaner Degreaser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (440, 'Lichen And Algae Remover', 'documents/Lichen_5L.jpg', '', '', 'For best results dilute solution with water and apply with brush or sprayer. Be sure to saturate porous surfaces. Consult your Caskade representative for further information.

Light Duty 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 100 parts water
Medium Duty 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 50 parts water
Heavy Duty and Commercial Use 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 20 parts water', 'C2033980L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Lichen_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_LICHEN__ALGAE_REMOVER_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Lichen and Algae Removal is a safe and easy to use cleaner, formulated to effectively remove and control further regrowth of mould, algae, mildew and lichens. It is corrosive, and not harmful to vegetation.

It is important to note that Lichen and Algae Remover does not show immediate results but works slowly and effectively without damaging the surface. Some lichen and algae may take up to one week to remove. This product is biodegradable.', false, '', '', 'C2033800L20', 'Disinfectant/Algicide Remover', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (441, 'Moss Kill', 'documents/Mosskill_5L.jpg', '', '', 'For best results dilute solution with water and apply with brush or sprayer. Be sure to saturate porous surfaces.

Light Duty 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 50 parts water .
Medium Duty 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 25 parts water.

Heavy Duty and Commercial Use 1 part Lichen and Algae Remover Concentrate to 10 parts water.
Interiors (walls, floors and ceilings) Apply and leave on the surface for as long as possible, without drying out. Wash or sponge off excess residue.

Exteriors (roofs, patios, brickwork, fences, pathways etc) Apply and leave on the surface for as long as possible. Do not apply before rain showers. Leave for a few days and remove with a stiff brush or high-pressure water spray. Alternatively, leave the product to dry on the surface and allow for the weather to do the work, results may take several weeks.', 'C2034030L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CAKSADE_MOSSKILL_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Moss Kill is a safe and easy to use cleaner, formulated to effectively remove and control further regrowth of mould, algae, mildew and lichens. It is corrosive, and not harmful to vegetation.

It is important to note that Moss Kill does not show immediate results but works slowly and effectively without damaging the surface. Some lichen and algae may take up to one week to remove. This product is biodegradable.', false, '', '', 'C2034020L20
C2033840L200', 'Algae Mould Moss & Lichen Control', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (442, 'Mountain Breeze Tablets', '', '', '', 'Mountain Breeze tabletsare suitable for use in lavatories, urinals, sick rooms and
all public places. Simply place deodorising tablets in urinal and leave to evaporate.
When size of a tablet has reduced to a size which would risk it to go through the grid
into the drain, replace with a new tablet. Because Mountain Breeze tablets are
compressed, they are long lasting and do not readily wash away.

Consult your Caskade representative for further information', 'C2021360K4', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Mountain Breeze tablets are evaporating tablets manufactured from pure
paradichlorobenzene crystals. They are pleasantly perfumed with a slow release rate,
which helps continually deodorise areas where odour control is essential.', false, '', '', '', 'Concentrated Deodorant Block', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (443, 'No Rinse Floor Cleaner', 'documents/Caskade_No_Rinse_Floor_Cleaner_5L.jpg', 'documents/Floor_Cleaner_Icon.png', '', '•
Dilute into cold water
•
Bucket 1-60
•
Machine 1-100
•
Can also be diluted into a trigger spray
•
Apply and clean floor surface, no rinsing required. Leave to air dry', 'C3000300L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/No_Rinse_Floor_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASAKDE_NO_RINSE_FLOOR_CLEANER_2021.pdf', 72, 'Caskade No Rinse Floor Cleaner is neutral and ideal for all sealed and un sealed floor types. It is an effective cleaner without the need to rinse ensuring lower costs of labour. It is fast drying and smear free with an easy to use process of apply and leave.', false, '', '', '', 'Neutral No Rinse Floor Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (506, 'Auto Q', 'documents/AUTO_Q.jpg', '', '', 'Dilute 1:100- 1:50 for light soiling and spray and wipe applications.Dilute 1:20 for medium soil levels and 1:10 - 1:2 for heavy 
cleaning and degreasing. Rinse with potable water before use.', 'FK-AUTOQ05', 'Kemsol', 'documents/Auto_Q_-_PI.pdf', 'documents/KEMSOL_-_Auto_Q_-_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Powerful alkaline cleaner and quaternary (QAC) sanitiser. Excellent for removal of food soiling, greases, oils and fats. Suitable for cleaning and sanitising food process and food service items, baking equipment, commercial cooking utensils and vessels. Also suitable for heavy-duty manual sink cleaning and for cleaning floors and walls.nMay also be used on open work surfaces such as work tables that contact food, providing these can be rinsed and drained completely, in order to prevent pooling of detergent residues.', false, '', '', 'FK-AUTOQ20', 'Alkaline Cleaner Sanitiser', 'Alkaline Cleaner Sanitiser');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (444, 'Phosbright 60', 'documents/Phosbright_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Scale Removal: Dilute to 2% (20mL/litre or 1:50) to remove water hardness deposits or milkstone in CIP systems. Circulate at 60°C for 30 minutes then rinse. Cooler water may be used with higher concentrations or longer contact times. Rinse with cold water.
Automatic Dishwashers are best de-scaled by shutting off the automatic feed, dosing as above (20mL/litre), then running for 15 minutes. Where circulation is not possible scale removal may be accelerated by using hotter water, longer reaction times, or by scrubbing.
Rust Removal: Neat or diluted up to 30% (300ml/litre). Apply to surface for 5 - 30 minutes. Rinse with cold water.
Hooks, Slides and Gambrels: Use at 7% minimum at 80-90C for 5-10 minutes when part of a 5 bath system.', 'C2052410L05', 'Caskade', '', 'documents/CASKADE_PHOSBRIGHT_60_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Phosbright 60 removes water hardness, milkstone deposits and sanitises in one operation. It also removes surface rust from ferrous metals and protects against subsequent re-rusting. Phosbright 60 may be used with CIP equipment, spray systems, soak tanks or manually. Phosbright 60 contains over 60% phosphoric acid, wetting agents, and 2.0% alkyl benzyl dimethyl ammonium chloride minimum. Wear gloves, eye protection and protective clothing. Phosbright 60 may be identified by its clear pink appearance, pH of 0-2, density greater than 1.30 Kg/L, and a minimum of 600g/L phosphoric acid by titration.', false, '', '', 'C2052400L20', 'Acid Detergent Cleaner Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (445, 'Radiant', 'documents/Radiant_5L.jpg', '', '', '•Radiant is most easily used with an atomiser hand spray.
•Use Radiant neat or diluted with water to up to 1:5.
•Spray onto the glass surface rub well with an absorbent dry cloth until dry. If the cloth becomes too damp, turn to a new surface or use another.', 'C2080830L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Radiant_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_RADIANT_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Radiant is a carefully balanced formula for the spray cleaning of windows, glass partitions mirrors, as well as stainless steel and chrome.

Radiant removes finger marks and other residues and leaves the surface with a sparkling shine. Radiant is used in hotels, motels, clubs etc. on refrigerators, stainless steel objects, wall tiles and mirrors.

Radiant can also be used to clean wind-screens and may be added to the windscreen washer reservoir to remove road grime.

Radiant may also be used for cleaning laminated surfaces, vinyl and baked enamel surfaces. Do not use on wooden furniture, waxed or polished finishes.', false, '', '', 'C2080540L20', 'High Performance Window Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (446, 'Safe Touch', 'documents/Safetouch_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Wet hands then apply 2ml directly onto hands from dispenser or plunger pack.
Lather well and rinse off. Repeat if required.', 'C2072370L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Safe_Touch_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_SAFETOUCH_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Safe Touch C51 Anti-Bacterial Hand Soap is a colour-free & fragrance-free liquid
hand soap specifically formulated for use in food production premises. It is highly effective where a wide range of users create high bacterial risks. Safe Touch C51 produces a smooth, soft and creamy lather that cleans hands well and keeps them moist and supple. It is a powerful cleaner, yet soft on the hands. It also has skin conditioning properties.

Safe Touch is a scientifically prepared anti-bacterial hand soap formulation containing a coconut oil derivative to soften, prevent chapping and drying out of hands.', false, '', '', 'C2072360L20
C2072120L200', 'Oleic Based Antibacterial Liquid Soap', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (447, 'Soft Hands - White', 'documents/Softhands_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Wet hands and apply a small amount of Soft Hands to the palm. Massage well into hands working up a rich lather and rinse well under running water.

To prevent microbial contamination of the product, close containers immediately after use and do not add or insert any foreign materials or objects.', 'C2071900L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Soft_Hands_PI_White.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_SOFTHANDS_LIQUID_SOAP_White.pdf', 72, 'Soft Hands is a liquid hand soap formulated with mild surfactants and coconut oil. It provides gentle clean and supports healthy skin.

Soft Hands is ideal for use in all washroom facilities, in areas such as hotels, restaurants, nursing homes and hospitals, in order to maintain an optimum level of personal hygiene.

Soft Hands will not de-fat the skin and has been blended to offer gentle treatment to skin of all types.', false, '', '', 'C2071890L20', 'Perfumed Flowing Hand Lotion', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (448, 'Soft Hands - Pink', 'documents/SoftHands_Pink_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Wet hands and apply a small amount of Soft Hands to the palm. Massage well into hands working up a rich lather and rinse well under running water.

To prevent microbial contamination of the product, close containers immediately after use and do not add or insert any foreign materials or objects.', 'C2073730L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Soft_Hands_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_SOFTHANDS_LIQUID_SOAP_PINK.pdf', 72, 'Soft Hands is a liquid hand soap formulated with mild surfactants and coconut oil. It provides gentle clean and supports healthy skin.

Soft Hands is ideal for use in all washroom facilities, in areas such as hotels, restaurants, nursing homes and hospitals, in order to maintain an optimum level of personal hygiene.

Soft Hands will not de-fat the skin and has been blended to offer gentle treatment to skin of all types.', false, '', '', 'C2072180L20', 'Perfumed Flowing Hand Lotion', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (449, 'Spice', 'documents/Spice_5L.jpg', 'documents/Disinfectant_Icon_62f7gsn.png', '', 'For hard surface treatment for bathrooms, janitorial floors and toilet surfaces use at a ratio of 1:100 - 1:50 (1-2% soln, 10-20mls per litre) with warm or cold potable water.

For extended microbial activity double the recommended dosage.

Use undiluted as a deodoriser or in exceptionally unsanitary conditions. Either wipe or spray onto surfaces, leave for a few moment, then wipe clean.', 'C2042350L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Spice_PI.pdf', 'documents/Caskade_Disinfectant_Spice_MSDS.pdf', 72, 'A concentrated, commercial grade disinfectant-sanitiser-deodoriser and cleaner combination ideal for restaurants, bars, hotels/motels, educational & health facilities, and other public use facilities where a hygienic smell and appearance are critical.', false, '', '', 'C2042350L20', 'Commercial Cleaner Disinfectant', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (450, 'Strike', 'documents/Strike_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Dilute in accordance to the intensity of soiling.
For light cleaning use at a ratio of 1:100 (1% solution, 50ml per 5 litres) with potable warm or cold water.
Heavy cleaning use at a ratio of 1:20 (5% solution, 50ml per litre). MPI APPROVED C31 (All animal product except dairy)
Before use, all edible product and packaging material must be removed from the room. After using this compound, food surfaces must be thoroughly rinsed with potable water before production starts.', 'C2055430L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Strike_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_STRIKE_AMMONIA_CLEANER_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Strike is a concentrated ammonia-based hard surface detergent cleaner. Effective for removing dirt, grease and grime from floors, walls and other hard surfaces. Septic tank safe, when used as directed.', false, '', '', '', 'Powerful Ammoniated Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (451, 'Toilet Care Thick', '', '', '', 'Use full strength in toilet bowls and on urinals. Pour on and allow to sit for 30 seconds to 1 minute. Agitate with a toilet brush for best results. Rinse clean.', 'C2021580L05', 'Caskade', '', '', 72, 'Toilet Care Thick is a liquid concentrate, containing a buffered acid and Q.A. disinfectant. It is a specifically blended acidic cleaner designed to remove build up in both toilet bowls and urinals. Once removed, Toilet Care Thick’s detergent action suspends the organic build up and uric acid so it is washed out of the system.
It removes stains and encrustations from porcelain, enamel, ceramic and stainless steel surfaces. Such soils are the source of offensive odours. It cleans and disinfects all areas, visible and invisible – downpipes from urinals, baths, sinks and shower stalls.
Toilet Care Thick passes the T.G.A. test for hospital grade disinfectants under dirty conditions (Option B) when used at recommended strength.', false, '', '', '', 'Hospital Grade Toilet Cleaner Disinfectant', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (452, 'Touch & Glo', 'documents/TouchGlo_5L.jpg', '', '', 'It is recommended that the spot test be conducted in an inconspicuous area before
use. Spray undiluted directly onto the surface, using an atomiser. Spread polish evenly
over entire surface with a soft absorbent cloth. While turning the cloth frequently,
lightly buff until gloss finish. Do not rub heavily. For difficult or hard to reach surfaces,
pour or spray directly onto cloth.
Consult your Jasol representative for further information.', 'C2080840L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/TouchGlo_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_TOUCH_AND_GLO_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Touch & Glo is a unique spray-on citrus perfumed emulsion, designed to clean,
polish and protect fine timber furniture and panelling, laminated plastic, marble and
stoved enamelled surfaces. It is also excellent for use on vinyl upholstery, stainless
steel and plated surfaces.

Dirt smears and finger-print smudges are quickly removed, and the product buffs up
effortlessly to a mellow, long-lasting gloss finish. The specially selected ingredients
give Touch & Glo superb protective qualities creating a smooth, hard, smear and
water resistant surface. It allows the treated surfaces to be more easily dusted and
maintained.', false, '', '', '', 'Cleaner/Polish/Protectant', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (453, 'Tutti Frutti', 'documents/Tutti_Frutti_5L.jpg', 'documents/Disinfectant_Icon_62f7gsn.png', '', 'For hard surface treatment for bathrooms, janitorial floors and toilet surfaces use at a ratio of 1:100 - 1:50 (1-2% soln, 10-20mls per litre) with warm or cold potable water.
For extended microbial activity double the recommended dosage.
Use undiluted as a deodoriser or in exceptionally unsanitary conditions. Either wipe or spray onto surfaces, leave for a few moment, then wipe clean.', 'C2044240L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Tutti_Frutti_PI.pdf', 'documents/Caskade_Tutti_Frutti_Disinfectant_SDS.pdf', 72, 'A concentrated, commercial grade disinfectant-sanitiser-deodoriser and cleaner combination ideal for restaurants, bars, hotels/motels, educational & health facilities, and other public use facilities where a hygienic smell and appearance are critical.', false, '', '', '', 'Commercial Cleaner Disinfectant', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (454, 'Wash N Shine', 'documents/WashNShine_5L.jpg', '', '', '1. Add 1 to 2 capfuls (for machine and manual cleaning) of Wash n Shine to 10 litres of warm water. Approximately 15 to 30mL per 10L bucket.
2. Apply by spraying or by hand washing then simply hose suds off.
3. Where necessary, ensure all gritty dirt is removed prior to rubbing down.
4. Be careful not to let suds dry while washing as this may cause streaking.
5. When car is dry, polish with a clean dry soft cloth.', 'C2122530L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/WashnShine_PI.pdf', 'documents/Wash_n_Shine_August_2020.pdf', 72, 'Wash n Shine is a high performance vehicle shampoo concentrate containing speciality silicone waxes for cleaning, conditioning and obtaining a surface shine on all painted surfaces.
Wash n Shine is especially useful for vehicles that must look clean all the time – vehicles on display in car yards, food delivery vehicles, taxis and buses will benefit their image with regular use of Wash n Shine.
It is a one shot system to save time and labour. It protects all paintwork from oxidation and extends life expectancy.
The Silicone wax base enhances appearances after re-washing. Wash n Shine is a completely water soluble, amber, viscous liquid containing a complex blend of anionic and non-ionic surfactant and silicone waxes.', false, '', '', 'C2121430L20
C2121430L200', 'Vehicle Shine and Polish', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (455, 'Waterlilly', 'documents/Waterlilly_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Waterlilly can be dispensed through spray gun or by placing a small volume into the cap or similar on a ledge or in a discreet position in your toilet or ablution block.

Waterlilly can be diluted 1:5 or 1:10 with water depending on the desired effect.', 'C2044210L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/Waterlilly_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_WATERLILLY_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Waterlilly is a pleasantly perfumed, water based reodorant, ideally suited as a space reodorant in rooms, toilets and anywhere a pleasant residual odour is required.

Waterlilly has excellent residual properties, lasting for up to 24 hours. It will not sour; it maintains its freshness and appeal long after it was applied.

Waterlilly is non-toxic and contains only biodegradable surfactants when tested in accordance with AS 1792 - 1976 and contains no phosphates.', false, '', '', '', 'Neutral Reodorant', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (456, 'Zap', 'documents/Zap_5L.jpg', '', '', 'For best results squirt Zap onto the surface then wipe the film to spread the detergent evenly. Leave for 30-60 seconds then rinse off. Thick deposits may need some scrubbing action prior to rinsing.', 'C2035340L05', 'Caskade', 'documents/ZAP_PI.pdf', 'documents/CASKADE_ZAP_SHOWER_CLEANER_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Zap is based on a mild organic acid and powerful detergent technology with a pleasant citrus fragrance to provide safe effective and naturally pleasant smelling cleaning of all bathroom surfaces without hard scrubbing.
Zap will remove stubborn scum and grime and thus eliminates most bacteria and mould by removing their nutrition and their place to live!
Zap is safe to use the hard surfaces such as shower screens, tiles, taps, sinks, toilets, baths, spas, and benchtops made from acrylic, chrome, stainless steel, ceramics, and fibreglass, that are found in bathrooms, kitchens, and laundries. Zap is safe to use in septic systems. Zap must not be used on marble surfaces.
Zap revives the sparkle that should be in your bathroom!', false, '', '', 'C2033260L200
C2033270IBC', 'Shower and Bathroom Cleaner', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (457, 'Blue Stripe', 'documents/Blue_Stripe_10kg.jpg', '', '', 'DOMESTIC USE: 1 scoop per normal 5kg wash. Up to 2 scoops for heavily soiled garments.
