If treated fabric directly or indirectly comes in contact with edible product, a thorough rinse with potable water must follow the laundering process.', 'BSLP10BAG', 'Geller', '', 'documents/Geller_Blue_Stripe_SDS_July_2021.pdf', 72, 'A highly concentrated powder suitable for commercial and domestic use, including front-loading machines. Does not contain bulk fillers. Contains powerful surfactants and optical brightening agents to enhance fabric appearance. Works well on light, medium and heavy soiling, and is suited to domestic, hotel, motel and on-premise laundry applications. Do not apply directly onto fabric without diluting. Suitable for use in hot or cold water.', true, '', '', '', 'Concentrated Laundry Power', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (458, 'Bowl Blast', 'documents/5329958_-_Bowl_Blast_5L_hoxSviY.jpg', 'documents/5329958_-_Bowl_Blast_5L.jpg', '', 'Flush toilet, then squirt a liberal amount around the top of the bowl, beginning up under the rim to allow the product to cover all surfaces, and run down the surface.
