MPI APPROVED C32 (All animal product except dairy) All product contact surfaces must be thoroughly rinsed with potable water before production starts', 'BOWLB', 'Geller', 'documents/II073_Bowl_Blast_PI.pdf', 'documents/Geller_Bowl_Blast_Toilet_Bowl_Cleaner_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Bowl Blast , Disinfects & Deodorises and is a high-viscosity cleaner and disinfectant designed for toilet bowls, urinals, and stainless-steel surfaces. Its formula clings to surfaces, minimising scrubbing while effectively eliminating germs and odors. Safe for septic tanks when used as directed, Bowl Blast ensures a fresh, clean finish every time', true, '', '', 'BOWLB05
BOWLB20', 'Porcelain & Stainless Steel Cleaner/Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (459, 'Caustic Soda Pearl', 'documents/Caustic_Soda_500g.jpg', '', '', 'Dilute for use by adding slowly up to 100 grams of Caustic Soda per litre of COLD wate in a plastic bucket. Mix until dissolved. Care Heat will be evolved. Wear Gloves and eye protection.', 'CAUSODA500', 'Geller', 'documents/Caustic_Soda_PI.pdf', 'documents/Geller_Caustic_Soda_Drain_Cleaner_MSDS.pdf', 72, 'This material in intended for use by a trained person familiar with its application. Refer to Safety Data Sheet for safety information.', true, '', '', 'CAUSODA05', 'Drain Cleaner/Water Treatment/ Neutralising Agent', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (460, 'Graffiti Remover', 'documents/Graffitti.jpg', '', '', 'GRAFFITI REMOVER comes Ready-to-use. Apply undiluted and DO NOT LEAVE TO DRY on any surface.', 'GRAFREM05', 'Geller', '', 'documents/Geller_Graffiti_Remover_MSDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'High strength multi-purpose cleaning agent for the removal of tar, rubber marks, graffiti and other heavy soiling from a variety of surfaces. GRAFFITI REMOVER is suited to most non-porous washable surfaces.', true, '', '', '', 'High-Strength for ease of Graffiti removal', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (461, 'Head-To-Toe', 'documents/HeadtoToe_Summer_5L_copy.jpg', '', '', 'Apply 5ml (1 tsp) by hand directly from the dispenser or plunger pack to wet hair. Lather well and rinse off. Repeat if required.', 'HEATOTSF05', 'Geller', 'documents/II073_HeadtoToe_Summer_PI.pdf', 'documents/Geller_Head_To_Toe_Summer_Fruits_MSDS.pdf', 72, 'Produces a smooth creamy lather that cleans hair without drying the scalp and leaving a soft lingering fragrance. Shampoo can be used everyday, it’s soft on hair and gentle on skin.', true, '', '', '', 'Shampoo Body Wash - Summer Fruits', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (462, 'Supreme Premium Pink', 'documents/Cartidge_Lotion_Supreme_Handwash_GLHAND01.jpg', '', '', 'Wet hands then apply 2ml directly onto hands from dispenser or plunger pack. Lather well and rinse off. Repeat if required.', 'GLHAND01', 'Geller', 'documents/II073_Supreme_Pink_PI.pdf', 'documents/Geller_Cartridge_1L_Supreme_Flowing_Soap_MSDS.pdf', 72, 'Supreme produces a smooth, soft and creamy lather that cleans hands well and keeps them moist and supple. It is a powerful cleaner, yet soft on the hands. It also has skin conditioning properties Premium is a scientifically prepared anti-bacterial hand soap formulation containing a coconut oil derivative to soften, prevent chapping and drying out of hands.', true, '', '', 'PREPIN05
PREPIN20', 'Perfumed Flowing Hand Soap Anti-Bacterial', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (463, 'Medic Shield - Aerosol', 'documents/MedicShield_Aerosol_500ml.jpg', 'documents/Spray_Surface_Icon_OxdB6KU.png', '', '1) De-energise electrical equipment before applying
2) Remove all equipment, and any gross soiling by manual scraping and discard hygienically.
3) Shake well. Hold container upright 15cm to 20cm from Surface, Allow to contact the surface for at least five minutes.
4) Wipe out the area or rinse clean the area to remove the sanitising solution
5) Leave the area to dry thoroughly or dry with a clean towel.', 'MEDICHGSS500', 'Geller', 'documents/MedicShield_Aeresol_PI_Sheet.pdf', 'documents/MedicShield_Surface_Sanitiser_Aerosol_sds_v1.pdf', 72, 'MedicShield Aerosol includes the additional Power of Alcohol which will kill most bacteria, including mycobacteria, and is effective in concentrations over 60%. Alcohol has particularly good activity against viruses such as herpes, HIV, Influenza, and Hepatitis B&C with moderate activity against Hepatitis A. It has also been shown to be effective in disinfecting surfaces contaminated with pandemic viruses such as Ebola and SARS Coronavirus and has some activity against Norovirus, Ebola virus, and several coronaviruses. The Journal of Hospital Infection concludes: “Human corona viruses can remain infectious on inanimate surfaces for up to 9 days. Surface disinfection with 62-71% Alcohol significantly reduces corona virus infectivity on surfaces within 1 min exposure time. We expect a similar effect against the SARSCoV-2”.', true, '', '', '', 'Hospital Grade Surface Spray Disinfectant/Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (464, 'Medicshield - Concentrate', 'documents/MedicShield_Concentrate_5ltr.jpg', '', '', '1) Remove all equipment, and any gross soiling by manual scraping and discard hygienically.
2) Dilute the MedicShield to a rate of 10 to 1 with clean water using either a spray bottle or cloth and wipe or spray over the entire area. Allow to contact the surface for at least five minutes.
3) Wipe out the area or rinse clean the area to remove the sanitising solution.
4) Leave the area to dry thoroughly or dry with a clean towel.

This product is safe to use on all common hard surfaces that are used in Hospitals, Doctor or Dental Clinics and Laboratories. MedicShield solution will not harm plastics, aluminium, stainless steel or fabrics at correct dilution rates.', 'MEDICSHIELD05', 'Geller', 'documents/II048_MS_PI.pdf', 'documents/MedicShield_SDS_Sheet_10_1.pdf', 72, 'MedicShield is a hard surface cleaner and sanitiser that is proven to be effective against a range of bacteria, fungi and viruses that can cause disease especially in those that are in a weakened state.

MedicShield is specifically designed so as to be pH neutral in use, and triggers no Hazno Classifications so it is safe for the user and the environment where the product is been used in. MedicShield has application in Medical, Dental, Aged Care and Laboratory facilities.
Unlike other products that have to be used undiluted, MedicShield will give proven results at an economical cost when diluted correctly (10 to 1).', true, '', '', '', 'Hospital Grade Disinfectant/Surface Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (507, 'Auto-Uni', 'documents/AUTO-UNI.jpg', '', '', 'Heavy spray n wipe: dilute with water 1:50 - 1:10
Interior cleaning with wet vac or extracti on machine: dilute 1:20 - 1:100. 
Exterior cleaning to remove road fi lm and soiling: dilute 1:50 - 1:100. 
Can be used neat under the bonnet for smog removal.', 'FK-AUTOUNI05', 'Kemsol', 'documents/Auto-Uni_-_PI.pdf', 'documents/KEMSOL_-_Auto-Uni_-_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Concentrated multi-purpose cleaner specifically designed for use in automotive applications. Recommended at varying dilutions for degreasing engines, under bonnet cleaning, interior and exterior vehicle cleaning and is used successfully as a floor scrubbing additive for workshop floor with grease and oil soiling.', false, '', '', 'FK-AUTOUNI20', 'Universal Automotive Cleaner', 'Universal Automotive Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (465, 'Medicshield - Ready To Use', 'documents/MedicShield_Trigger_Spray_750ml.jpg', 'documents/Disinfectant_Icon_t03Isbf.png', '', '1) Remove all equipment, and any gross soiling by manual scraping and discard hygienically.
2) Shake well.Hold container upright 15cm to 20cm from Surface, Allow to contact the surface for at least five minutes.
3) Wipe out the area or rinse clean the area to remove the sanitising solution
4) Leave the area to dry thoroughly or dry with a clean towel.', 'MEDICHGSS750TS', 'Geller', 'documents/II048_MS_PI_RTU_mppxu3e.pdf', 'documents/MedicShield_Hosptial_Grade_Surface_Sanitiser_RTU_SDS_nyOt2sr.pdf', 72, 'MedicShield is Suitable for the following:
In Intensive Care Units - Cleaning and disinfection of all hard surfaces.
In Operating Theatres - Cleaning and disinfecting tables disinfect equipment, cables and will not adversely affect surfaces.
For Blood spills - MedicShield is ideal for cleaning and disinfecting blood spills on all hard surfaces.
Telephones - MedicShield is ideal for disinfecting phones where large numbers of bacteria are found.
In Dental and GP Surgeries - MedicShield can be used in Dental and GP surgeries for cleaning and disinfecting surfaces including chairs, stools, tables benches and light fittings.
In Laboratories & Pathology Clinics - MedicShield is excellent for wiping down benches, disinfection of white rooms, cleaning and disinfection of fume cupboards, etc.
CSSD - Cleaning bench tops, stainless steel surfaces, sinks, trolleys, tap fittings.
In Toilets Showers and Sinks - Tile Surfaces, and all hard surfaces.', true, '', '', 'MEDICSHIELD05RTU', 'Hospital Grade Surface Disinfectant/Sanitiser', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (468, 'Commercial Bleach', 'documents/Rapid_Commercial_Bleach_5L.jpg', 'documents/Bleach_In_Sink_Icon.png', '', 'Bleaching of Clothes - Manual Dilute BLEACH 20 mls per 10 litre of cold water, Soak for 10 minutes. Rinse thoroughly with clean water.

