For Cleaning Bathrooms & Kitchens – To remove stains, mould, mildew, body fat and soap scum from hard surfaces dilute ½ cup (125ml) of BLEACH to 1 litre of cold water and apply to surface to be cleaned and disinfected. Leave for a few minutes before rinsing with clean water.', 'RAP140280', 'Rapid', 'documents/Bleach4_PIS_2018_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Bleach_MSDS.pdf', 72, 'BLEACH is a chlorine activated bleach and sanitiser for use in laundries, kitchens, restaurants, bathrooms and toilets.

BLEACH may be used in a number of applications including the following:
• Stain removal of kitchen crockery
• Bleaching of clothes
• Hard surface sanitiser in bathrooms and kitchens
• Cleaning and disinfecting of toilets and urinals', false, '', '', 'RAP140290
RAP140295', 'Industrial Strength Bleach & Disinfectant', 'Industrial Strength Bleach & Disinfectant');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (469, 'Eclipse', 'documents/Eclipse-10kg-2.jpg', '', '', 'FOR MACHINE USE: Dilute Eclipse Concentrated Laundry
Powder in cold to warm water.
1. Do not add direct to clothes.
2.Normal soil 1 scoop into a 5kg load. Heavy soil 2 scoops into a 5kg load.
3. Rinse items well then air dry.

AS A PRE-SOAKER:
1. Dilute 1 scoop into 10 litres of water.
2.Allow to soak.
3. Wash items under normal conditions.', 'RAP140263', 'Rapid', 'documents/Eclipse_PIS_2019_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Eclipse_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Eclipse is a free flowing white powder combining a blend of powerful cleaning agents and detergents. Eclipse ensures maximum cleaning performance on all soils encountered leaving fabrics clean with a fresh residual fragrance.

Eclipse can be used in all types of washing machines, front and top loading to remove a wide range of household stains including grease, fat, blood, oil, dirt and perspiration. Eclipse is also suitable in industrial washing machines for use in on premise laundries such as nursing homes, motels and hotels.', false, '', '', 'RAP140270
RAP140265', 'Concentrated Laundry Power', 'Concentrated Laundry Power');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (470, 'Ecoclean', 'documents/Rapid_Ecoclean_5L.jpg', 'documents/Disinfectant_Icon_ypZv9PX.png', '', 'FOR GENERAL CLEANING: use Ecoclean at a dilution rate of 1 in 80. FOR HEAVIER SOILS AND BAKED ON DIRT, a 1 in 40 dilution rate may be required. Rinse surface with potable water after use. Ecoclean may be used through a higher pressure cleaner and is considered safe to use on all surfaces including aluminium.', 'C2042540L20', 'Rapid', 'documents/Rapid_Clean_PIS_Ecoclean.pdf', 'documents/ECOCLEAN_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Ecoclean is a bright yellow liquid combining a heavy duty detergent system with a powerful disinfectant and natural citrus solvents. Ecoclean cleans and sanitisers all surfaces and is safe on all metals including aluminium. Ecoclean can be used for a number of purposes from degreasing equipment, to dissolving cooking oils and baked on grime from kitchen surfaces. It is also an excellent floor cleaner. 

Ecoclean can be used on a wide range of applications and include the following:
 Floors – For the mopping of kitchen floors to remove greasy food soils and associated grime.
 Bathrooms – For the removal of body fat and soap scale build up.
 Spray ‘N’ Wipe applications – effectively cleans to a streak free and antibacterial finish.', false, '', '', 'C2042540L05', 'Heavy Duty Cleaner, Disinfectant & Sanitiser', 'Heavy Duty Cleaner, Disinfectant & Sanitiser');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (471, 'Extreme', 'documents/Rapid_Extreme_5L.jpg', '', '', '1. Top loading machines: use ½ cup for a normal wash load.
