For heavy soiling use ½cup.

3. Hand washing and soaking: ½ cup to a bucket (5 litres).

4. Pre spotting: Pour a small quantity onto the stain, rub gently and place soiled garment and balance of detergent into the wash.', 'RAP140200', 'Rapid', 'documents/Extreme_PIS_2019_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Extreme_Laundry_Liquid_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Extreme is a clear, thick blue liquid combining a blend of powerful cleaning agents, detergents and speciality optical brighteners. Extreme ensures maximum cleaning performance on all soils encountered leaving fabrics clean and bright with a fresh residual fragrance.
Extreme can be used in all types of washing machines, front and top loading to remove a wide range of household stains including grease, fat, blood, oil, dirt and perspiration. Extreme is also suitable in industrial washing machines for use in on premise laundries such as nursing homes, motels and hotels.', false, '', '', 'RAP140210', 'Concentrated Laundry Detergent', 'Concentrated Laundry Detergent');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (472, 'Hi-Genic', 'documents/Rapid_Green_Hi_Genic_5L_tmcLVg8.jpg', 'documents/Bathroom_Cleaner.png', '', 'For Bathroom 1:25 Dilute 200ml in 5L of cold water.

For toilets use product undiluted

1. Squirt on to surface to be cleaned and scrub
with a nylon brush.
2. Allow 5 mins contact time.
3. Flush / Rinse with water.', 'RAP140360', 'Rapid', 'documents/RAPID_GREEN_EC_TDS_INFO_SHEETS_HI_GENIC.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Clean_-_EC_Hi-Genic_SDS_v1.0_March2022.pdf', 72, 'All Over Washroom Cleaner is formulated using the latest technology to make it one of the most eco-preferred plant based acid cleaners in New Zealand. Hi-Genic will not discolour stainless steel
