cleaner, formulated to quickly penetrate, emulsify and remove light to medium soils. From kitchens,
cafeterias, boardrooms, rest rooms & offices our natural all purpose cleaner cuts grease, grime
and dirt as well as traditional cleaners. 
Rapid Clean Spray ''N'' Wipe is made from plants and minerals it leaves no harsh chemical fumes or residue, and since it''s 100% natural, it''s better for the environment too.', false, '', '', 'RAP150410', 'Multi Purpose Cleaner', 'Multi Purpose Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (474, 'Grill Master', 'documents/Rapid_Grill_Master_5L_NyAYcpd.jpg', 'documents/Grill_Cleaner_Icon_jL4gAgp.png', '', 'Spray GRILL MASTER using foam head on to warm 50°C surface.
Cover soiled areas with foam, let stand 5-10 minutes.
