Avoid contact with aluminium and painted surfaces.', 'RAP140050', 'Rapid', 'documents/GrillMaster_PIS_2018_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Grill_Master_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'GRILL MASTER is a heavy duty caustic based detergent combining specialty surfactants with water softening agents to provide maximum cleaning on mild steel, cast iron and stainless steel surfaces. N.B: GRILL MASTER must not be used on reactive metals such as aluminium.

GRILL MASTER is specifically formulated to remove heavy deposits of grease, fat, oil and carbonised soils from hot plates and ovens. It is also recommended for cleaning stainless steel canopies and benches in kitchen environments.', false, '', '', 'RAP140060', 'Heavy Duty Oven & Grill Cleaner', 'Heavy Duty Oven & Grill Cleaner');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (475, 'Hand Sanitiser', 'documents/Rapid-Hand-Sanitiser-Group-2.jpg', '', '', '1. Apply one thumbnail amount size to dry, clean hands.
2. Rub well ensuring thorough coverage of your hands.
3. Allow it to dry and it will kill bacteria within 30 seconds.', 'RAP140920', 'Rapid', 'documents/RapidHandSanitiser-PIS-WC.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Instant_Hand_Sanitiser_SDS.pdf', 72, 'Rapid Hand Sanitiser is an alcohol based hand sanitiser gel which kills bacteria within 30 seconds. Contains Glycerine moisturiser to prevent dryness. It leaves your hands soft and smooth. This product is ideal for use in homes, offices, child cares, aged cares, nursing homes, hospitality areas, outdoor areas, public places and more.', false, '', '', 'RAP140935
RAP140925', 'Sanitising Gel', '');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (476, 'Machine Plus', 'documents/Rapid_Machine_Plus_5L.jpg', 'documents/AutoDishwash_Icon_zUTJhsg.png', '', 'MACHINE PLUS is dosed automatically through the dispensing unit and maintained at a concentration of 1 - 2 gm /litre. Operating temperature is normally between 75 - 80°C. 
MACHINE PLUS should always be used in conjunction with RINSE PLUS (Rinse Aid) to ensure all washed articles are completely clean and dry.', 'RAP140100', 'Rapid', 'documents/MachinePlus_PIS_2018_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Machine_Plus_SDS_.pdf', 72, 'MACHINE PLUS is a pale amber liquid based on a blend of heavy duty alkaline detergents combined with soil suspending agents, anti-scaling components and a stabilised chlorine de-staining agent.

MACHINE PLUS is formulated especially for use with Automatic Dispensing Equipment. This is a complete hands-free system which ensures optimum concentration and economy of use of detergent is maintained at all times. The dispenser involves the use of a potentiometric probe which “senses” detergent concentration in the wash tank and signals the pump when to add more detergent.', false, '', '', 'RAP140105
RAP140110', 'Dishwashing Machine Detergent', 'Dishwashing Machine Detergent');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (477, 'Rinse Plus', 'documents/Rapid_Rinse_Plus_5L.jpg', 'documents/Rinse_Aid_Icon.png', '', 'RINSE PLUS is injected into the final rinse water on all machines by the use of highly specialised electronic dosing equipment that injects the correct amount of product each time the rinse cycle is activated. The results obtained with RINSE PLUS are influenced by several factors, these being temperature of the final rinse water, efficiency of the dish washer rinse, residual heat held by the article
being washed and the quantity of RINSE PLUS used.', 'RAP140120', 'Rapid', 'documents/RinsePlus_PIS_2018_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Rinse_Plus_Drying_Aid.pdf', 72, 'RINSE PLUS is a drying agent which when added to the final rinse water of glass or dish washing machines, by means of a specially designed feeder, dramatically reduces drying time of washed articles. RINSE PLUS also markedly improves the finished appearance of crockery, glassware and cutlery by eliminating water spotting. 

RINSE PLUS is a blue moderately viscous liquid and contains ingredients which, when mixed with water at 60-90°C rapidly lowers the surface tension of water and prevents water from forming droplets on a surface. This product is equally effective in both soft and hard water as it contains a water softener and antiscaling agents. RINSE PLUS eliminates the need for manual
toweling of washed articles, thus reducing the possibility of spreading pathogenic organisms due to this method of drying. RINSE PLUS is safe on all metals normally found in the construction of dish washing and glass washing machines.', false, '', '', 'RAP140125', 'Rinse Aid for Machine Dishwashing', 'Rinse Aid for Machine Dishwashing');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (478, 'Kleen Crème', 'documents/Rapid_Kleen_Creme_5L.jpg', '', '', 'Use Kleen Crème as a wipe-on, wipe-off.
Apply direct or use a sponge to soiled surfaces.
Clean and rinse with fresh clean water or a damp cloth.
Replace top immediately after use', 'Z140840', 'Rapid', 'documents/Shine_PIS_2018_NZ.pdf', 'documents/Rapid_Shine_Creme_Cleanser_SDS_2021.pdf', 72, 'Kleen Crème  is powerful creme cleanser which cleans and shines enamels, tiles, stainless steel and chrome plated surfaces without scratching.

Kleen Crème  has been specially formulated to clean and shine most hard surfaces such as enamels, tiles stainless steel, chrome. Typical areas which SHINE would be most advantageous would be hard surfaces which would be encountered in a kitchen area. Stains, grease and dirt marks are all quickly and easily removed from most hard surfaces.', false, '', '', 'RAP140830', 'Non Abrasive Creme Cleanser', 'Non Abrasive Creme Cleanser');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (479, 'Trojan', 'documents/Rapid_Trojan_5L.jpg', 'documents/Floor_Cleaner_Icon_vGEIdal.png', '', 'General cleaning of floors and other washable surfaces, dilute
Trojan according to soil levels.
Light Soil - 1:80 with cool water.
