"MPI APPROVED C31 (All animal product except dairy).
Before use, all edible product and packaging material must be removed from the room. After using this compound, food surfaces must be thoroughly rinsed with potable water before production starts MPI Approved C 43 (All animal product except dairy). In the case of operators that only process fish, food contact surfaces must be thoroughly drained to minimise residues and must not imply that it can be used as a non-rinse sanitiser by any other operators."', 'SANIPLUS', 'Geller', '', 'documents/Geller_SaniPlus_SDS_2021.pdf', 69, 'SaniPlus is a powerful hard surface cleaner and sanitiser, specifically formulated to combat a wide range of bacteria, fungi, and viruses, making it ideal for environments where hygiene is critical, such as food service, medical, dental, aged care, and laboratory facilities. Unlike many other products that require undiluted use, SaniPlus delivers proven, cost-effective results when diluted at a 1:5 ratio, ensuring both efficiency and economy. Laboratory tested by the internationally recognized BluTest Laboratories Ltd, SaniPlus is proven to effectively kill a broad spectrum of bacteria and viruses, including Coronaviruses such as SARS-CoV-2 (COVID-19). For detailed testing results please contact us', true, '', '', 'SANIPLUS05', 'Hospital Grade Disinfectant / Sanitiser', 'Surface Sanitiser');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_product VALUES (655, 'Detergent Hand Pump', 'documents/2230412.jpg', '', 'RRP: $139.00', 'This robust, resilient unit delivers a precise measurement of chemical every time via a large, spring-loaded dispensing button', 'HP30SN00000', 'Equipment', '', 'documents/prodose-r-technical-data-sheet-en-v1.pdf', 69, 'Manual pump', false, '', '', '', '', 'Code: HP30SN00000');
