INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (4, 'MedicShield', 'Home', 'MedicShield s a major development in advanced cleaning and disinfecting technology from Geller. This hard surface cleaner and sanitiser that is proven to be effective against a range of bacteria, fungi and viruses and has been Tested and Proven to kills Coronaviruses including SARS-CoV-2 (COVID-19).', 'documents/MediShield_BrkjXHN.jpg', 'home', 'See Our Range of MedicShield Products', 'https://geller.co.nz/our_products/17', '#c41fb4', '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2024-10-24 20:38:36.905545+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (6, 'News Image', 'Home', '', 'documents/bobn.png', 'news_img', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (7, 'About Us', 'About', 'Geller is a multi-sector chemical cleaning and specialty chemical product company that manufactures a full line of commercial quality cleaners for the Hospitality, Industrial, Automotive, Laundry, Educational, and Rest home markets

The product line includes:
•	Automotive cleaners, and Additives 
•	Industrial cleaners, Cutting Fluids
•	Degreasers and Floor cleaners and Protectors
•	Laundry Powers and Liquids
•	Hand cleaners; and Hand Soap Systems
•	Odour control;
•	Vehicle wash and care products.', 'documents/shutterstock_204151534.jpg', 'About Us', NULL, NULL, '#000000', '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2024-11-12 20:02:25.179052+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (9, 'THE BEST ECO FRIENDLY CLEANING PRODUCTS ARE HERE!', 'News', 'Geller,s range of Environmental Choice certified products are unique, powerful, effective and based on nature. They are proven environmentally better by carrying the seal of government-backed Environmental Choice New Zealand.', 'documents/GREEN.PNG', 'Geller Green is here!', 'See the full range of Environmental Choice certified products', 'https://geller.co.nz/our_products/2', '#000000', '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (12, 'MPI Guidelines -(formally NZFSA)', 'Support', 'The following are some of the MPI Approval guidelines typical for some Geller products. They are an abbreviated guide only and should NOT be used to replace the authorized MPI Approval classifications. For a full explanation please refer to the MPI Approvals handbook.

C23
This may be used in edible areas. All edible product must be removed from the room. No edible product is permitted in the room until all treated surfaces have been adequately protected with an approved coating.

C31
This may be used in all areas. Before use all edible product and packaging material must be removed from the room.

C32
This may be used in edible areas. The perfume must not be used to mask the odours of unsanitary conditions. This compound must be used in a manner that prevents the perfume invading any edible area.

C33
This is a laundry compound. If treated fabric directly or indirectly comes in contact with edible product, a thorough rinse with potable water must follow the laundering process.

C35
Window cleaner for all areas. No edible product is permitted in the room during cleaning. Incidental contamination of food contact surfaces must be thoroughly cleansed, then rinsed with potable water.

C37
General purpose detergent which is not for use on food surfaces, but may be used on floors and walls.

C38
This may be used for cleaning large processing rooms provided the room can be divided into distinct areas, no edible product or packaging material is present in the area during cleaning, and there can be no possibility of contamination of product or packaging material as a result of cleaning.

C41
This may be used in all areas. Before use, all edible product and packaging material must be removed from the room or carefully protected.

C43
This may be used as a no-rinse sanitiser on clean hard surfaces in licensed premises which are restricted only to the processing of fish.

C51
Hand washing and sanitising compound for use in all areas. After using', '', 'MPI Guidelines', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (13, 'Hazardous Substances Toolbox', 'Support', 'The EPA has created a Hazardous Substances Toolbox to help small, industrial workplaces safely manage their substances. This multi-media package contains helpful guidance on how you can identify and manage health risks.

It''s really important that staff understand both the harm that can be caused by the hazardous substances they use and how they can protect themselves.

See... www.hazardoussubstances.govt.nz/', 'documents/hs-toolbox-button.png', 'Hazardous Substances Toolbox', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (14, 'Dilution Rates', 'Support', 'Dilution Rates
How to use this chart...
 
Simply check the size of your container across the top of the chart.
Then read down the left hand side until you find the required dilution rate.
Match the two together, this is the amount of product you need to add to achieve the desired dilution rate.', 'documents/DILUTION_RATES.PNG', 'Dilution Rates', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (15, 'MedicShield', 'Home', 'MedicShield is a major development in advanced cleaning and disinfecting technology from Geller .MedicShield is a hard surface cleaner and sanitiser that is proven to be effective against a range of bacteria, fungi and viruses that can cause disease especially in those that are in a weakened .MedicShield has been Tested and Proven to kills Coronaviruses including SARS-CoV-2 (COVID-19).', 'documents/MediShield.jpg', 'home_row1_col2', 'See Our Range of MedicShield Products', '/product/111', '#000000', '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-25 08:19:51.638958+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (16, 'Geller', 'Home', 'Guests, customers, employees, anyone and everyone – it doesn’t matter who, in today’s society we demand a clean, safe and healthy environment no matter where we go. Geller is the go-to brand for those with livelihoods depending on delivering this this cleanliness. For effective, user-friendly cleaning strength, nothing beats Geller.', 'documents/GellerGroup3.jpg', 'latest_news', 'Click here to see the range', '/our_products/all', '#000000', '2022-09-06 00:38:09.707021+00', '2022-09-13 03:58:18.482874+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (17, 'TRAINING & EDUCATION PORTAL', 'Support', 'Training You Can Count On: Every Care, Every Step.

Welcome to our one-stop training and resource centre, helping to educate and improve knowledge.

We Care About Your Success – Protecting Your Brand with Expert Training for Improved Outcomes
Geller provides expert training that equips staff to use chemicals safely and effectively. Our training increases safety, enhances compliance, and reduces the risk of accidents, ensuring better outcomes for your business and brand.

On-Site Training:
During service calls, we can conduct on-site training to support compliance with your policies, improve cleaning procedures and results, and reduce claims from mishandling and chemical-related accidents.

On-Demand Training:
Geller has an online platform for on-demand interactive training modules that cover the following areas:

Hazardous Substances & Chemical Safety
Cleaning & Sanitizing
Staff Health & Hygiene
Infection Control
360 Food Retail Training', 'documents/Picture4.jpg', 'Training', 'Click here to go to our dedicated Online Training Platform.', 'https://ultimoprotect.getlearnworlds.com/', '#000000', '2024-10-22 10:07:33.536555+00', '2025-04-01 17:41:00.935762+00');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_post VALUES (19, 'Geller is proud to introduce you to the Ultimo Chemical Dispensing system and product solutions. Delivering you a simpler, safer & faster cleaning systems.', 'Home', 'Geller is proud to introduce you to the Ultimo Chemical Dispensing system and product solutions.', 'documents/Ultimo_Photo_.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, '#000000', '2024-10-29 00:42:58.222151+00', '2024-10-29 00:42:58.222226+00');


