INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (2, 'Geller Green', 'Geller Green - Environmentally sustainable and Environmentally Responsible “Green” cleaning products which are Eco Choice Aotearoa Licensed. These products pass an additional set of stringent and measurable standards.

Eco Choice Aotearoa has been the country’s official ecolabel for more than 30 years. Founded by the Ministry for the Environment, the ecolabel only certifies products and services which are environmentally preferable, safe for you and your family and fit-for-purpose', '', false, '#1fb51c');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (4, 'Kitchen', 'A restaurant’s cleaning-heart is its automatic dish and glass wash process. Not only do we need an eagle-eye on the key touch-points of cutlery, glass ware and crockery but also ensuring these are delivered at optimal cost, with maximum food and staff safety. Geller has many years experience in the art of  successful warewash and their national teams are dedicated to thoroughly assessing and developing all elements of a successful cleaning program – from rafters to drains. Our customer aim is for the lowest and safest possible cost per wash in the New Zealand market, in a no-nonsense, pragmatic approach to site assessment, testing and ongoing improvements. Talk to your Geller representative today about a free, no-obligation site audit.', '', false, '#c2f604');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (5, 'Disinfectants, Sanitisers & Cleaners', '.', '', false, '#f00abe');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (6, 'Janitorial', 'Commercial/janitorial cleaning makes up a significant portion of cleaning in New Zaland– from hospitals to hostels, airports to zoos, and everything in between. Geller specialises in not only products to clean surfaces safely, effectively and hygenically, but including latest odour and fragrance control technology to assist maximise the cleaning and post-cleaning experience.', '', false, '#f20707');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (7, 'Floor', 'The challenging and vast number of flooring types combined with specific customer needs and foot traffic volumes  requires flexibility with formulation, and the right advice, first time. Whether high-care polished surfaces or the most durable high-level soiling situations, Geller have a product that is right for your situation.', '', false, '#9b04ec');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (8, 'Laundry', '.', '', false, '#ee9d2b');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (9, 'Multi Purpose', 'Due to the specific nature water conditions in different parts of the country, and the vast nature of soiling levels and types, the need exists for a corresponding selection of multipurpose products. Geller has developed a product range here to take care of the special needs for all of New Zealand. Give yourself a “check-up” today and ask us what we think you could be doing better. Whether it is compliance or improve the results and safety with your cleaning program, Geller knows what it takes', '', false, '#0736f2');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (10, 'Hand & Body Care.', '.', '', false, '#06b0db');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (11, 'Industrial & Transport', '.', '', false, '#121212');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (13, 'Geller Pro Floor', '.', '', false, '#6d08af');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (14, 'Geller Pro Textile Care', 'A challenge is posed for today’s Commercial and On Premise laundry product manufacturers and suppliers in that it is not all about the product. Factors such as mechanical action, water condition and levels, machine programming, load levels, garment and soiling types all play critical parts in the success of clean linen, at the right price. Challenge a Geller representative today about your program!.', '', false, '#f36c12');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (16, 'Geller Technical', 'Many products within the Geller range are MPI Approved (formally NZFSA) for use in audited food plants and operations within NZ.', '', false, '#0f14ae');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (17, 'Medical', '.', '', false, '#5f4cbd');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (18, 'Odour Control', 'Geller is at the worlds cutting edge of commercial and industrial odour control. Specialist blending and formulation strategies have assist our global export success story. From the heaviest land-fill situations to the most delicate hospitality room spray, and the advice to match!', '', false, '#181616');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (20, 'Ultimo', 'Geller is proud to introduce you to the Ultimo Chemical Dispensing system and product solutions.
Delivering you a simpler, safer & faster cleaning systems.

Easy and safe to use
The Ultimo dispenser allows for the dilution of up to four chemicals. Chemical selection is via an intuitive four-way dial on the front of the unit. Push button operation allows for filling of bottles while the locking capability ensures rapid filling of sinks for larger cleaning and sanitising applications.

Colour coded chemical system
Gellers Ultimo unique system of colour coded chemicals, dispenser labels, Spray Bottles chemical lines, line tags, container caps and container labels ensures complete continuity from container to application. This makes it easy to identify and connect the correct chemical for changeover, delivery and dispensing

Safe and controlled
GELLER® ULTIMO irremovable closures  ensures a secure closed dispenser / container arrangement.', '', false, '#979191');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (21, 'SoftShield Hand Care', 'The Best in Hand Care-Geller', '', false, '#62cb7c');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (27, 'All Products', 'All Products', '', true, '#252222');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (28, 'New Products', 'TBC', '', false, '#000000');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (29, 'Feature Products', 'Geller Medical range of Hospital grade products, for user''s demanding the most effective cleaning and sanitising products', '', false, '#1f1e1e');
INSERT INTO public.chemsapp_productcategory VALUES (30, 'MPI Approved Products', 'Geller  Green -Environmentally sustainable, eco friendly, and Environmentally Responsible “Green” cleaning products which are Environmental Choice NZ Licensed. These products pass an additional set of stringent and measurable standards - they are safer and more environmentally responsible than most product available.', '', false, '#0f0f0f');


